    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the SONGMICS Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper, selected by KASODI for its two-section laundry storage, warm bamboo frame and practical top shelf."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/songmics-bamboo-double-laundry-hamper.png"
            alt="SONGMICS bamboo double laundry hamper styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM
          </p>

          <h1>
            Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            SONGMICS
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A practical two-section laundry hamper that makes everyday sorting
            feel a little more considered. Soft cream fabric bags sit within a
            warm bamboo frame and are topped with a useful shelf, combining
            generous laundry storage with a calm, natural look.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>100 L</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>63 × 33 × 78 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Sections</span>
              <strong>2 removable bags</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Frame</span>
              <strong>Bamboo</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Bags</span>
              <strong>Oxford fabric</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Laundry · Sorting · Bathroom storage</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/3SupOsg"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Laundry storage is usually chosen for function first, but this one
            manages to do both. The two separate compartments make it easy to
            sort laundry as you go, while the removable fabric bags can be
            lifted out individually when it is time to wash.
          </p>

          <p>
            We also like the bamboo shelf. It gives the hamper a more finished,
            furniture-like presence and creates useful space for folded towels,
            baskets or everyday bathroom essentials.
          </p>

          <p>
            The combination of cream fabric and warm bamboo keeps a highly
            practical piece visually quiet enough to live in an open bathroom,
            bedroom or laundry area.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Made for everyday use</h2>

        <p>
          Wipe the bamboo frame and top shelf with a soft, slightly damp cloth
          and dry promptly. Avoid leaving standing water on the bamboo surface.
        </p>

        <p>
          Keep the fabric laundry bags dry between uses and follow the
          manufacturer's care instructions when cleaning them. Avoid
          overloading the compartments to help the bags and frame retain
          their shape.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Soft Cotton Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Fold warm white, ivory or oatmeal towels on the upper shelf to
              keep everyday essentials within easy reach.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Woven Storage</h3>
            <p>
              Add a small woven basket to the shelf for laundry accessories or
              smaller bathroom essentials while continuing the natural texture.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Warm Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Cream ceramic accessories echo the soft fabric tones and create
              a more cohesive, considered bathroom palette.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set-cream.png"
                alt="Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM ACCESSORIES</span>
              <h3>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set</h3>
              <p>Ava Nord</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer.png"
                alt="Glass and Gold Vanity Organizer"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>VANITY ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer</h3>
              <p>HARLIANGXY</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-botanical-duvet-cover-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-duvet-cover-set.png"
                alt="Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME TEXTILES</span>
              <h3>Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set</h3>
              <p>Fashionbedding</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          SONGMICS · LAUNDRY & STORAGE
        </p>

        <h2>
          Make everyday laundry feel a little more organized.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/3SupOsg"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>